  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "濃紺の生地に　ポケモンの顔が浮かびあがる　ポップな　テーブルクロス。ゴーストタイプ好きの　必須アイテム。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "짙은 남색 천에 포켓몬의 얼굴이 드러나 있는 발랄한 테이블보. 고스트타입 애호가들의 필수 아이템이다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "帶有流行風的桌巾，深藍色的質地裡浮現出寶可夢的臉。幽靈屬性的愛好者絕對不可錯過。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une nappe pop art sur laquelle des visages de Pokémon flottent sur un fond bleu nuit. Un accessoire indispensable à tout fan de Pokémon Spectre qui se respecte.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein Tischtuch im Pop-Art-Design, bei dem die Gesichter von Pokémon mit dem dunkelblauen Stoff verschmelzen. Ein absolutes Muss für Fans von Geister-Pokémon.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un mantel de diseño pop en el que aparecen caras de varios Pokémon sobre un fondo azul oscuro. Perfecto para los amantes de los Pokémon de tipo Fantasma.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Tovaglia in stile pop art con delle facce di Pokémon che emergono dallo sfondo blu scuro del tessuto. Un oggetto irrinunciabile per gli amanti del tipo Spettro.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A pop-art-style tablecloth with Pokémon faces floating up from the deep nighttime blue. This is a must-have for fans of Ghost types.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
